.TH SDL_UnlockSpinlock 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_UnlockSpinlock \- Unlock a spin lock by setting it to 0.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_atomic.h>
.PP
.BI "void SDL_UnlockSpinlock(SDL_SpinLock *lock);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Always returns immediately\[char46]
.PP
.BR "Please note that spinlocks are dangerous if you don\(aqt know what you\(aqre doing\[char46] Please be careful using any sort of spinlock!"

.SH FUNCTION PARAMETERS
.TP
.I lock
a pointer to a lock variable\[char46]
.SH THREAD SAFETY
It is safe to call this function from any thread\[char46]

